# Content Factory

## Pipeline order (do not reorder)
Syllabus scope → NCERT evidence → Blueprint → LLM → Validation → NCERT claim grounding → Dedupe → Editorial → Publish

## Preflight
- Syllabus gate (`assert_blueprint_neet_syllabus_scope`) before NCERT evidence.
- NCERT evidence pack (`resolve_ncert_evidence_pack`) before any provider call when the blueprint declares NCERT.
- Generation ≠ validation ≠ publication.

## Blueprints
- Prefer existing constraint fields (`neet_ug_2026`, `ncert_source_path`, `ku_id`) over new tables.
- Surgical constraint merges must preserve unrelated keys.
- Idempotent remediation: second run → zero additional writes.
